PROVENANCE OF THIS NOTICE

The vocabulary in this crate was extracted from the `zai-org/GLM-4.5` model
repository on HuggingFace, which states: "They are released under the MIT
open-source license and can be used commercially and for secondary
development."

That repository publishes no LICENSE file, so there is no upstream copyright
line to reproduce here. The holder above names the model's publishing
organisation; the licence itself is upstream's own declaration, quoted above.

Note that the separate `zai-org/GLM-4.5` repository on GitHub — the inference
and training code, not the model — is Apache-2.0. This crate ships neither; it
ships the tokenizer vocabulary from the model repository, which is the MIT one.
